used to set modem interface and status parameters (modem directory number 9).  
The parameters vary with m--
DIALLING A NUMBER - enter the dialling directory and press "D". If the modem is
off the user will be prompted to turn it on and press RETURN. The screen will  
clear and the modem directory page will be displayed on the left half of the   
screen, aodem type (refer to manual supplied with the modem), 
and are loaded to the "number" field of a dialling directory with a user HASH  
character as the terminator. All other fields can be used as comment, as they  
